                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>JFK generated &gt;2× the revenue of Upper East Side South despite roughly half the pickup volume. Longer, higher-value trips—not volume alone—drive airport revenue.</run>
