                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Peak demand and peak trip duration do not coincide. Demand reaches its highest level around 7 PM, while the largest duration spike occurs around 3:30 PM.</run>
